{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_bdrk_2nx55vcx73gsitiits4wq4d556cx7djqwbed3vv6fitsxltwipda","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_bdrk_01GctfwrPqMtfqflsjUuebsW","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"fileKey":"htzJEgTQZM6qy0UMgMs235","description":"Read all text on Start Here and Foundations pages","code":"const out=[];\nfor (const id of ['0:1','1:2']) {\n  const p = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);\n  await figma.setCurrentPageAsync(p);\n  out.push('=== '+p.name);\n  const walk=(n,d)=>{\n    let s='  '.repeat(d)+n.type+' '+n.id+' \"'+n.name+'\"';\n    if('width' in n) s+=` ${Math.round(n.x)},${Math.round(n.y)} ${Math.round(n.width)}x${Math.round(n.height)}`;\n    if(n.type==='TEXT') s+=' :: '+n.characters;\n    if('fills' in n && n.type!=='TEXT' && Array.isArray(n.fills) && n.fills[0]?.type==='SOLID'){const c=n.fills[0].color;s+=' fill#'+[c.r,c.g,c.b].map(v=>Math.round(v*255).toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('');}\n    out.push(s);\n    if('children' in n) n.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,d+1));\n  };\n  p.children.forEach(c=>walk(c,0));\n}\nreturn out.join('\\n');"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26,"cache_creation_input_tokens":967,"cache_read_input_tokens":7907,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":967,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":39,"service_tier":"standard","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"26d7c23f-3381-47cf-9fcd-bed7f7968ebf","uuid":"525704f2-581f-4cf6-bb9a-926a984d5d19","timestamp":"2026-11-02T07:51:14.422Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_bdrk_01GctfwrPqMtfqflsjUuebsW","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01GctfwrPqMtfqflsjUuebsW","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== 00 · Start Here 设计任务\nFRAME 3:2 \"Start Here · Brief\" 0,0 1440x2688 fill#ffffff\n  FRAME 3:3 \"Header\" 64,64 1312x145\n    TEXT 3:4 \"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" 0,0 182x19 :: LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\n    TEXT 3:5 \"Budget — monthly expenses, bills and credit score\" 0,31 1312x52 :: Budget — monthly expenses, bills and credit score\n    TEXT 3:6 \"Design a personal budgeting app: see this month’s spending against the budget by category, check the monthly subscriptions, and review the credit score. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" 0,95 1312x50 :: Design a personal budgeting app: see this month’s spending against the budget by category, check the monthly subscriptions, and review the credit score. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\n  FRAME 3:7 \"How to work\" 64,257 1312x227\n    TEXT 3:8 \"How to work\" 0,0 147x35 :: How to work\n    TEXT 3:9 \"1. Build exactly the 3 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only the platform shell (status bar, home indicator) — this task has no primary button and no text input. Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the servi